                    "Assist in general tasks of the print shop, according to service needs.",
                    "Execute work orders supporting production, finishing, and packaging.",
                    "Keep the workspace and common areas clean and organized."
                ],
                "security": [
                    "Monitor and control access to the company's facilities during their shift (day/night).",
                    "Prevent risk situations such as theft, vandalism, or fires, and immediately report any irregularities to management.",
                    "Protect the physical integrity of people and material goods within the company's perimeter.",
                    "Immediately inform management and the competent authorities of any suspicious occurrence or criminal act."
                ],
                "production_manager": [
                    "Coordinate and supervise the production team, ensuring service quality and meeting deadlines.",
                    "Control stock of raw materials and request replenishment when necessary, avoiding production stoppages.",
                    "Report production results and any constraints to the employer periodically."
                ],
